[00:14.103]There were times we would drive 'til the sun broke
{"曾几何时我们驱车直至破晓"}
[00:17.615]Through the black of the night on a wide road
{"穿越黑夜在宽阔道路上"}
[00:20.544]Paved in dreams that led me back to you
{"铺满引我回到你身边的梦"}
[00:27.147]Lit a spark in the dark gave me no choice
{"黑暗中点燃火花让我别无选择"}
[00:30.412]In the night you're a light in the white noise
{"夜里你是白噪音中的光芒"}
[00:33.163]Suddenly, my heart said something new
{"突然间我的心说出新的话语"}
[00:39.081]
[00:39.250]In your eyes, I swear I feel forever
{"在你眼中 我发誓感受到永恒"}
[00:45.457]And I'm falling into the deepest part of you
{"我正坠入你灵魂最深处"}
[00:52.165]In your eyes, I feel my heart surrender
{"在你眼中 我感到心已臣服"}
[00:58.497]As your love breaks through
{"当你的爱破壁而来"}
[01:02.270]I'm Lost inside your deep blue
{"我迷失在你深邃的蓝"}
[01:06.060]
[01:15.785]Inside your deep blue
{"在你深邃的蓝"}
[01:18.888]
[01:31.074]Passing clouds skipping stars when I got you
{"拥有你时云朵掠过星辰跳跃"}
[01:34.387]In your arms cover stars like a tattoo
{"你臂弯里的星辰如纹身覆盖"}
[01:37.332]Rescue me and put back all the pieces
{"拯救我并拼回所有碎片"}
[01:43.767]How did I miss the times that you came through
{"我怎会错过你挺身而出的时刻"}
[01:47.189]When every glance was a chance I was blind to
{"当每次眼神交汇都是被我忽视的机会"}
[01:50.175]Now I see you're everything I needed
{"如今我明白你正是我所需一切"}
[01:55.700]
